:: MP NPC Sera Deep Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpInitNpcSera>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$mpSeraEnded and ($mpWorldSeraSecondFloor or $mpWorldSeraDeparted)>><<set $mpWorldSeraEnding to ($mpWorldSeraDeparted ? "depart" : "stay")>><<set $mpSeraEnded to 1>><</if>>
<<mpInitNpcCross>>
<<if $mpWorldSeraEnding is "stay">><<set _wk to Math.floor(Time.days / 7)>><<if (_sera.upkeepWeek or 0) isnot _wk>><<set _sera.upkeepWeek to _wk>><<money -25>><</if>><</if>>
高街钟表铺的玻璃橱窗后，几十座黄铜座钟与航海表以毫厘不差的节拍齐声滴答，校时牌上记着节律共鸣 <<print _sera.cadence>>、铜件储备 <<print $mpClockParts>> 份与父亲日记 <<print _sera.fatherLog>> 页。<<if $mpNpcCrossLast and $mpNpcCrossLast.sera>>修表台绒垫下还夹着一张便笺，写着「<<print $mpNpcCrossLast.sera>>」。<<else>>基准天文母钟的秒针稳稳划过铜盘。<</if>><<if $mpWorldSeraEnding is "stay">>二层工坊的灯一直亮到很晚，每周的铺面维护费从柜上单支一笔。<<elseif $mpWorldSeraEnding is "depart">>橱窗里少了一只常修的三问表，柜台后只剩代管的账册。<<else>>铺子里的钟声照旧。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[查看作息表 (0:06)|MP NPC Sera Schedule]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[承接修表委托 (0:06)|MP NPC Sera Repair Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[守候整点怀表窗 (0:06)|MP NPC Sera Watch Windows]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<if Time.days lt (_sera.setback or 0)>>
铺子这周不开门，铜牌翻到了「休整」一面。
<<elseif $mpSeraEnded>>
旧案已有结果。<<set _endQ to ($mpWorldSeraEnding is "depart" ? "MP NPC Sera Ending Departed" : "MP NPC Sera Ending SecondFloor")>><<link "翻看已经定下的结局 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<goto _endQ>><</link>>
<<elseif (_sera.stage or 0) lt 10>>
父亲的旧案还没走完。
<<elseif (_sera.love or 0) lt 30 and (_sera.trust or 0) lt 30>>
她还没把父亲的事交出来。
<<else>>
<<set _nextQ to "MP NPC Sera Quest Step 1">>
<<if (_sera.questStage or 0) is 1>><<set _nextQ to "MP NPC Sera Quest Step 2">>
<<elseif (_sera.questStage or 0) is 2>><<set _nextQ to "MP NPC Sera Quest Step 2B">>
<<elseif (_sera.questStage or 0) is 3>><<set _nextQ to "MP NPC Sera Quest Step 3">>
<<elseif (_sera.questStage or 0) is 4>><<set _nextQ to "MP NPC Sera Quest Step 3B">>
<<elseif (_sera.questStage or 0) gte 5>><<if $mpSeraIrreversibleChoice>><<set _nextQ to "MP NPC Sera Quest Step 4C">><<elseif $mpSeraReady>><<set _nextQ to "MP NPC Sera Quest Step 4B">><<else>><<set _nextQ to "MP NPC Sera Quest Step 4">><</if>>
<</if>>
<<link "继续追查父亲怀表 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<goto _nextQ>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Sera Tier And Loft [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _onTime to (Time.minute lte 15 or Time.hour is 8 or Time.hour is 12 or Time.hour is 18)>>
<<set $mpSeraSnapshot to { money: ($money or 0), stress: ($stress or 0), tiredness: ($tiredness or 0), pain: ($pain or 0), cadence: (_sera.cadence or 25), rep: (_sera.rep or 50), parts: ($mpClockParts or 0), w1: ($mpSeraW1 or 0), w2: ($mpSeraW2 or 0), w3: ($mpSeraW3 or 0) }>>
对于习惯用游丝振频衡量一切的<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>而言，守时与安静是最珍贵的默契。当前节律共鸣为 <<print (_sera.cadence or 25)>>：<<if (_sera.cadence or 0) gte 70>>她已经为你敞开了二楼阁楼的螺旋梯木栓<<elseif (_sera.cadence or 0) gte 35>>她会在修表台旁替你温上一杯佛手柑红茶<<else>>她每次听见推门声都会先核对一眼母钟分针<</if>>。
柜台上的黄铜座钟一格格平稳跳动，擒纵轮咬合的轻响在屋内回荡。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[准点赴约品茶 (0:15)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 15>><<if _onTime>><<if !$daily.mpSeraTea>><<set $daily.mpSeraTea to 1>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 6)>><<set _sera.love to Math.min(100, (_sera.love or 0) + 2)>><<stress -5>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<else>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.max(0, (_sera.cadence or 25) - 3)>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[安静坐台旁修表 (0:18)|MP NPC Sera Repair Hub]]>><<pass 18>><<if !$daily.mpSeraSitRepair>><<set $daily.mpSeraSitRepair to 1>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 5)>><<set _sera.trust to Math.min(100, (_sera.trust or 0) + 2)>><<stress -5>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpgearicon>><<link [[陪她给旧摆轮点油 (0:10)|MP NPC Sera Daily 15]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Repair Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpInitNpcSera>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopDay_sera isnot Time.days>><<set $mpNpcLoopDay_sera to Time.days>><<set $mpNpcLoopLock_sera to "none">><</if>>
<<set $mpSeraSnapshot to { money: ($money or 0), stress: ($stress or 0), tiredness: ($tiredness or 0), pain: ($pain or 0), cadence: (_sera.cadence or 25), rep: (_sera.rep or 50), parts: ($mpClockParts or 0), w1: ($mpSeraW1 or 0), w2: ($mpSeraW2 or 0), w3: ($mpSeraW3 or 0) }>>
修表台绒盘上摊着几件还没拆开的委托，手边只剩 <<print ($mpClockParts or 0)>> 份黄铜零件。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把灯往柜台边挪了挪，说今天只够守一处：要么在铺里修那台远洋船钟，要么上钟楼看镇钟。她朝墙角那套铜架抬了抬下巴——<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_sera is "chrono">>船钟台已经支好，钟楼的梯子今天就别上了<<elseif $mpNpcLoopLock_sera is "tower">>工具已经装进帆布包，铺里的台子也收了<<elseif $mpNpcLoopLock_sera is "third">>柜台让给了那只有问刻的怀表，船钟和钟楼都只能等明天<<else>>两处离得远，跑一头就赶不上另一头<</if>>。<<if $mpWorldSeraEnding is "depart">>自她出海后，三问表那一路客单也跟着断了。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[精校航海钟 (0:20)|MP NPC Sera Repair Chrono]]>><<pass 20>><<set $mpSeraTargetWatch to 1>><</link>><br>
<<mpbellicon>><<link [[登钟楼修副机芯 (0:22)|MP NPC Sera Repair Tower]]>><<pass 22>><<set $mpSeraTargetWatch to 3>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpWorldSeraEnding is "depart">><<link "三问表客单随船走了 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Repair Lockout">><</link>><<elseif $mpNpcLoopLock_sera is "none" and !$daily.mpSeraRepairThird>><<link "留在柜台校三问表 (0:20)">><<pass 20>><<set $mpNpcLoopLock_sera to "third">><<set $daily.mpSeraRepairThird to 1>><<set $mpSeraTargetWatch to 2>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Repair Puzzle">><</link>><<else>><<link "留在柜台校三问表 (0:20)">><<pass 20>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Repair Lockout">><</link>><</if>><br>
<<link [[查阅机械时刻 (0:08)|MP NPC Sera Timetable]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Repair Chrono [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_sera is "tower" or $mpNpcLoopLock_sera is "third">>
修表台上的灯和铜架已经收进木匣。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>看了一眼母钟，说今天手上的准头已经用在别处了，这会儿再碰那根细得像发丝的游丝，只会把眼睛熬花。
<<else>>
<<set $mpNpcLoopLock_sera to "chrono">>
远洋船钟卡在黄铜架子上，钟楼那边的梯子今天就不上了。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把灯罩压低，光聚在钟面上：这活儿要一直盯着那根细得几乎看不见的游丝。修好了，她手上的节拍会顺很多；可盯久了，眼睛会酸得发胀。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回委托 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Repair Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_sera is "tower" or $mpNpcLoopLock_sera is "third">>
<<walkicon>><<link [[查看互斥代价 (0:06)|MP NPC Sera Repair Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[屏息拨双轴游丝 (0:18)|MP NPC Sera Repair Puzzle]]>><<pass 18>><<tiredness 3>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 6)>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[逐齿核算发条张力 (0:16)|MP NPC Sera Repair Puzzle]]>><<pass 16>><<tiredness 2>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 4)>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Sera Repair Tower [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_sera is "chrono" or $mpNpcLoopLock_sera is "third">>
钟楼侧门的铜牌已经挂回柜台暗钩。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>摇了摇头，说今天的手劲和眼力都花在别处了，那套量钟的家伙也不能再挪，镇钟只能等明天再上。铺里的灯也懒得再点，她只把明日的时辰写在铜牌背面。
<<else>>
<<set $mpNpcLoopLock_sera to "tower">>
你们提着沉重的黄铜扳手登上高街钟楼的机芯层，铺里那台船钟今天就顾不上了。大钟的擒纵叉每跳一下，脚底的铁板都跟着发麻。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>递来防滑手套：拆洗大钟能多拆出几件备用铜件，可搬动那些铸铁配重最费力气。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回委托 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Repair Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_sera is "chrono" or $mpNpcLoopLock_sera is "third">>
<<walkicon>><<link [[查看互斥代价 (0:06)|MP NPC Sera Repair Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpgearicon>><<link [[合力扳动配重锤 (0:18)|MP NPC Sera Repair Puzzle]]>><<pass 18>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 1>><<set $mpClockParts to ($mpClockParts or 0) + 1>><</link>><br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[用煤油刷净旧齿槽 (0:16)|MP NPC Sera Repair Puzzle]]>><<pass 16>><<tiredness 2>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 4)>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Sera Repair Lockout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
半点报时刚落，<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>没去收工具，只从绒盘里拈起两枚齿数不同的黄铜齿轮，并排举到灯下让你看齿尖的咬合线。她说同一天里手腕忽轻忽重，就像把错齿的轮子硬塞进轮系：起初还能转，转到第三圈就会把整列轴心一起别弯。她把剩下那套夹具摆回原位，在黄铜排班牌上替你写好明日的时辰，才吹熄无影灯。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回修表委托 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Repair Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[回契约深枢歇手 (0:06)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Repair Puzzle [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpInitNpcSera>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<set _w to ($mpSeraTargetWatch or 1)>>
<<set $mpSeraPuzzleOk to 0>>
<<set _wState to (_w is 1 ? ($mpSeraW1 or 0) : (_w is 2 ? ($mpSeraW2 or 0) : ($mpSeraW3 or 0)))>>
你将选中的<<if _w is 1>>远洋双轴航海钟<<elseif _w is 2>>银雕三问怀表<<else>>市政厅镇钟副机芯<</if>>固定妥当，当前精密铜件储备为 <<print ($mpClockParts or 0)>> 份。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把护目寸镜戴在右眼，让你从齿轮配比、游丝调校或擒纵拨正中挑一门拿手的手艺复原机芯。<<if _wState is 1>>这只表本周的工钱已经结算过，再拆也拿不到第二份报酬。<<elseif _wState is -1>>这只表已经停在你手里，她说先别硬碰，等她把游丝养回来，或者用怀表把时间拨慢一拍。<<else>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回委托 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Repair Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<if _wState is 0>>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[按算术配齿轮 (0:18)|MP NPC Sera Repair Settle]]>><<pass 18>><<if ($mpClockParts or 0) gte 1 and (($maths or 0) gte 200 or (_sera.cadence or 25) gte 45)>><<set $mpSeraPuzzleOk to 1>><<else>><<set $mpSeraPuzzleOk to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[按科学调校游丝 (0:18)|MP NPC Sera Repair Settle]]>><<pass 18>><<if ($mpClockParts or 0) gte 1 and (($science or 0) gte 200 or (_sera.cadence or 25) gte 45)>><<set $mpSeraPuzzleOk to 1>><<else>><<set $mpSeraPuzzleOk to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpgearicon>><<link [[动手拨正卡死擒纵 (0:18)|MP NPC Sera Repair Settle]]>><<pass 18>><<if ($mpClockParts or 0) gte 1 and (($skulduggery or 0) gte 200 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 200)>><<set $mpSeraPuzzleOk to 1>><<else>><<set $mpSeraPuzzleOk to 0>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[本周已锁死 (0:06)|MP NPC Sera Repair Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Sera Repair Settle [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpInitNpcSera>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<set _w to ($mpSeraTargetWatch or 1)>>
<<set _wState to (_w is 1 ? ($mpSeraW1 or 0) : (_w is 2 ? ($mpSeraW2 or 0) : ($mpSeraW3 or 0)))>>
你放下黄铜镊子，把关照灯拨到摆轮上方，屏息看它走字，账册与工钱都等这一锤定音。<<if _wState is 1 or _wState is -1>>这只表本周已经结算或锁定，工钱与父亲手记都不会再重复发放。<<elseif ($mpSeraPuzzleOk or 0) is 1>>
<<set $mpClockParts to Math.max(0, ($mpClockParts or 1) - 1)>>
<<if _w is 1>><<set $mpSeraW1 to 1>><<elseif _w is 2>><<set $mpSeraW2 to 1>><<else>><<set $mpSeraW3 to 1>><<set $mpSeraTimetableUnlocked to 1>><</if>>
<<set _sera.fatherLog to Math.min(6, (_sera.fatherLog or 0) + 1)>>
<<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 8)>>
<<set _pay to ($mpWorldSeraEnding is "depart" ? 450 : 650)>><<money _pay>><<stress -5>><<tiredness 2>>
擒纵轮一声轻响，金色摆轮重新稳稳摆动。拆洗底盖时，你们从暗槽夹层取出了下一页父亲手记，并领到了足额工钱。
<<else>>
<<if ($mpClockParts or 0) gte 1>><<set $mpClockParts to ($mpClockParts or 1) - 1>><</if>>
<<if _w is 1 and ($mpSeraW1 or 0) is 0>><<set $mpSeraW1 to -1>><<elseif _w is 2 and ($mpSeraW2 or 0) is 0>><<set $mpSeraW2 to -1>><<elseif _w is 3 and ($mpSeraW3 or 0) is 0>><<set $mpSeraW3 to -1>><</if>>
<<set _sera.cadence to Math.max(0, (_sera.cadence or 25) - 4)>>
<<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>>
铜镊滑了半毫，发条闷响缩回原位，白耗一份铜件。本单失败分文未得，这只表得在柜台里静养几天，她说等游丝回弹了再试。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回委托 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Repair Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpmap2icon>><<link [[查阅全镇时刻 (0:06)|MP NPC Sera Timetable]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[拨逆跳表慢一拍 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Watch Rewind]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[回总枢续父志旧页 (0:12)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Timetable [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
钟表铺内侧与高街钟楼联动的「全镇机械时刻盘」在灯下缓缓转动，铜盘上刻着六位伙伴的常驻动向：晨间阿什在北岭、莫奈在防波堤、诺艾尔在苗床；午后林恩巡多姆斯街、塞拉守修表台；入夜维斯驻三号栈桥。<<if $mpWorldScheduleShortened>>受雾角撤离钟声影响，夜航与高街打烊钟点已提前一格。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回钟表总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[拆旧座钟补两零件 (0:16)|MP NPC Sera Repair Hub]]>><<pass 16>><<if !$daily.mpSeraScrap>><<set $daily.mpSeraScrap to 1>><<set $mpClockParts to ($mpClockParts or 0) + 2>><<tiredness 2>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[去整点窗校音 (0:06)|MP NPC Sera Watch Windows]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpSeraTimetableUnlocked>><<mpgearicon>><<link [[精校母钟 (0:10)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if !$daily.mpSeraMasterClock>><<set $daily.mpSeraMasterClock to 1>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 2)>><<set $mpClockParts to ($mpClockParts or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP NPC Sera Watch Windows [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<set _hr to Time.hour>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
你握着怀表站在基准天文母钟前，当前时刻为 <<print _hr>> 点整。每日早六点、午十二点与晚十八点是母钟与全城塔钟共振的三个黄金窗口：<<if (_hr is 6 and !$daily.mpSeraWin6) or (_hr is 12 and !$daily.mpSeraWin12) or (_hr is 18 and !$daily.mpSeraWin18)>>此刻恰逢整点共振，铜摆振幅正处于顶点<<else>>此刻并非整点窗口，但仍可随她做日常校音<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[响应整点校音 (0:15)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 15>><<if _hr is 6 and !$daily.mpSeraWin6>><<set $daily.mpSeraWin6 to 1>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 8)>><<set $mpClockParts to ($mpClockParts or 0) + 1>><<stress -5>><<elseif _hr is 12 and !$daily.mpSeraWin12>><<set $daily.mpSeraWin12 to 1>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 8)>><<money 450>><<stress -4>><<elseif _hr is 18 and !$daily.mpSeraWin18>><<set $daily.mpSeraWin18 to 1>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 9)>><<set _sera.love to Math.min(100, (_sera.love or 0) + 3)>><<stress -6>><<else>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 2)>><<stress -2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[约定次日去品茶 (0:06)|MP NPC Sera Tier And Loft]]>><<pass 6>><<if !$daily.mpSeraTeaNext>><<set $daily.mpSeraTeaNext to 1>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 3)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[拨回逆跳怀表慢拍 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Watch Rewind]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Watch Rewind [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<set _canRewind to ($mpSeraRewindDay isnot Time.days)>>
你摩挲着那只双游丝逆跳怀表的银壳：<<if _canRewind>>当前逆跳发条已蓄满，今日可拨动一次「时间慢一拍」，把刚才失手的修表或错过的节律拨回动手前的样子<<else>>今日已经拨过一次慢一拍，双游丝要随昼夜交替重新蓄弦，明日才有力气再拨<</if>>。
柜台上的黄铜座钟一格格平稳跳动，擒纵轮咬合的轻响在屋内回荡。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回钟表总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[逆拨重开修表 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Repair Puzzle]]>><<pass 5>><<if _canRewind>><<set $mpSeraRewindDay to Time.days>><<if $mpSeraSnapshot>><<set _sera.cadence to $mpSeraSnapshot.cadence>><<set $mpClockParts to Math.max($mpClockParts or 0, $mpSeraSnapshot.parts)>><<if ($mpSeraW1 or 0) is -1>><<set $mpSeraW1 to $mpSeraSnapshot.w1>><</if>><<if ($mpSeraW2 or 0) is -1>><<set $mpSeraW2 to $mpSeraSnapshot.w2>><</if>><<if ($mpSeraW3 or 0) is -1>><<set $mpSeraW3 to $mpSeraSnapshot.w3>><</if>><<else>><<set $mpClockParts to ($mpClockParts or 0) + 1>><</if>><<stress -4>><<else>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[逆拨重开守时陪伴 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Tier And Loft]]>><<pass 5>><<if _canRewind>><<set $mpSeraRewindDay to Time.days>><<if $mpSeraSnapshot>><<set _sera.cadence to $mpSeraSnapshot.cadence>><</if>><<stress -4>><<else>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpInitNpcSera>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
铺子的门铃没有响。塞拉在柜台后抬起头，先看表，再看你，把手里那枚拆到一半的游丝放回绒盒。她说今天排不进父亲的旧案：该等的消息还没到，钟表铺的活也得按刻点做完。她把一杯温茶推到柜台边，让你先坐一会儿，或者明天再来问。
<<if (_sera.fatherLog or 0) lt 6 and (_sera.questStage or 0) lt 5>>柜台上压着父亲手记的残页，页角还缺着几页，她说修表匠的手艺换不来别人的记忆，只能一只表一只表地修。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回钟表总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[明天再来问一次 (0:06)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest Closed [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpInitNpcSera>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
铺子的卷帘门落下一半，铜牌翻到「休整」那一面。塞拉隔着玻璃朝你摇了摇头，没有开门，只把一张写好的便条按在窗上：这周不开门，表照旧收在柜台里，谁都别来碰。她转身回去，母钟的滴答声隔着玻璃，比平时更轻。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回钟表总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[过两天再来看看 (0:06)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest Step 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpInitNpcSera>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if Time.days lt (_sera.setback or 0)>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Closed">>
<<elseif Time.days lt (_sera.nextQuestDay or 0)>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif Time.hour lt 8 or Time.hour gte 20>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif (_sera.stage or 0) lt 10 or ((_sera.love or 0) lt 30 and (_sera.trust or 0) lt 30)>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif (_sera.questStage or 0) gte 1>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif (_sera.fatherLog or 0) lt 1>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<</if>>
柜台最底层锁着一只停在十年前的十一点四十七分的银壳怀表，那是<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>父亲出海失踪前留下的遗物。拧开后盖，摆轮被一枚特制的纯银止动销死死卡住，内盖上还刻着一串微缩的经纬与齿轮比数。她说旧案到今天才算真正开头，先把手记凑够一页，再动这只表。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回钟表总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[探查纯银止销 (0:15)|MP NPC Sera Quest Step 2]]>><<pass 15>><<if (_sera.cadence or 0) gte 35 or (_sera.trust or 0) gte 30>><<set _sera.questStage to Math.max(_sera.questStage or 0, 1)>><<set _sera.nextQuestDay to Time.days + 1>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 4)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<set _sera.setback to Time.days + 2>><<set _sera.rep to Math.max(0, (_sera.rep or 50) - 5)>><<set $mpClockParts to Math.max(0, ($mpClockParts or 0) - 1)>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpmap2icon>><<link [[拓录内盖微缩坐标 (0:14)|MP NPC Sera Quest Step 2]]>><<pass 14>><<if (_sera.cadence or 0) gte 35 or (_sera.trust or 0) gte 30>><<set _sera.questStage to Math.max(_sera.questStage or 0, 1)>><<set _sera.nextQuestDay to Time.days + 1>><<set _sera.trust to Math.min(100, (_sera.trust or 0) + 3)>><<stress -4>><<else>><<set _sera.setback to Time.days + 2>><<set _sera.rep to Math.max(0, (_sera.rep or 50) - 5)>><<set $mpClockParts to Math.max(0, ($mpClockParts or 0) - 1)>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest Step 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpInitNpcSera>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if Time.days lt (_sera.setback or 0)>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Closed">>
<<elseif Time.days lt (_sera.nextQuestDay or 0)>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif Time.hour lt 8 or Time.hour gte 20>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif (_sera.questStage or 0) isnot 1>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif (_sera.fatherLog or 0) lt 2>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<</if>>
在阁楼绘图桌上将父亲日记（已集齐 <<print (_sera.fatherLog or 0)>> 页）与旧港防波堤塔钟蓝图叠在一起时，止动销上的微缩刻度正好指向雾角主塔的地下潮汐钟室。然而蓝图右下角的行会审验章却被人用墨水涂黑了一半。她把蓝纸压平，说等手记再厚一页，才敢往那一页上落笔。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回钟表总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpmap2icon>><<link [[比对塔钟蓝图 (0:15)|MP NPC Sera Quest Step 2B]]>><<pass 15>><<if (_sera.cadence or 0) gte 40 or (_sera.trust or 0) gte 20>><<set _sera.questStage to Math.max(_sera.questStage or 0, 2)>><<set _sera.nextQuestDay to Time.days + 1>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 5)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set _sera.setback to Time.days + 2>><<set _sera.rep to Math.max(0, (_sera.rep or 50) - 5)>><<set $mpClockParts to Math.max(0, ($mpClockParts or 0) - 1)>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[拼合父志旧印章 (0:14)|MP NPC Sera Quest Step 2B]]>><<pass 14>><<if (_sera.cadence or 0) gte 40 or (_sera.trust or 0) gte 20>><<set _sera.questStage to Math.max(_sera.questStage or 0, 2)>><<set _sera.nextQuestDay to Time.days + 1>><<set _sera.trust to Math.min(100, (_sera.trust or 0) + 3)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set _sera.setback to Time.days + 2>><<set _sera.rep to Math.max(0, (_sera.rep or 50) - 5)>><<set $mpClockParts to Math.max(0, ($mpClockParts or 0) - 1)>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest Step 2B [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpInitNpcSera>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if Time.days lt (_sera.setback or 0)>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Closed">>
<<elseif Time.days lt (_sera.nextQuestDay or 0)>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif Time.hour lt 8 or Time.hour gte 18>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif (_sera.questStage or 0) isnot 2>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif (_sera.fatherLog or 0) lt 3>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<</if>>
十年前的旧案审结那天，铺里的基准天文母钟在十一时四十七分骤然停摆，至今没人敢拨回。你刚把塔钟蓝图摊上阁楼桌，母钟的秒针就在同一个时刻抖了一下，随即被死死咬住。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>跪坐到账房柜前，从底板夹层抽出一叠发脆的铜料单，末尾一张的落款正是师叔亲手签押的名字：当年他把劣质黄铜混进潮汐钟主轴，事败后把整笔账推给外出试航的父亲，逼得父亲连辩解的机会都没有。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回钟表总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[摊旧账上柜台 (0:15)|MP NPC Sera Quest Step 3]]>><<pass 15>><<set $mpSeraBetrayal to "expose">><<if (_sera.cadence or 0) gte 45 or (_sera.trust or 0) gte 20>><<set _sera.questStage to Math.max(_sera.questStage or 0, 3)>><<set _sera.nextQuestDay to Time.days + 1>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 5)>><<stress 2>><<else>><<set _sera.setback to Time.days + 2>><<set _sera.rep to Math.max(0, (_sera.rep or 50) - 5)>><<set $mpClockParts to Math.max(0, ($mpClockParts or 0) - 1)>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[合上账本把话咽下 (0:14)|MP NPC Sera Quest Step 3]]>><<pass 14>><<set $mpSeraBetrayal to "cover">><<if (_sera.cadence or 0) gte 45 or (_sera.trust or 0) gte 20>><<set _sera.questStage to Math.max(_sera.questStage or 0, 3)>><<set _sera.nextQuestDay to Time.days + 1>><<set _sera.trust to Math.min(100, (_sera.trust or 0) + 3)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<set _sera.setback to Time.days + 2>><<set _sera.rep to Math.max(0, (_sera.rep or 50) - 5)>><<set $mpClockParts to Math.max(0, ($mpClockParts or 0) - 1)>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest Step 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpInitNpcSera>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if Time.days lt (_sera.setback or 0)>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Closed">>
<<elseif Time.days lt (_sera.nextQuestDay or 0)>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif Time.hour lt 8 or Time.hour gte 18>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif (_sera.questStage or 0) isnot 3>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif (_sera.fatherLog or 0) lt 4>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<</if>>
你们冒着海雾赶到旧港防波堤尽头的雾角主塔，打开尘封十年的潮汐钟底舱。父亲当年藏在暗格里的双金属温差摆轮与恒力发条完好无损，但港务局的查封官却带着那位师叔堵在了塔门外，索要铺子的皇家天文钟特许状。塞拉把工具箱往你手里一塞，说这一趟只能拿一样东西走。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回钟表总枢 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[取出温差摆轮 (0:15)|MP NPC Sera Quest Step 3B]]>><<pass 15>><<if ($mpClockParts or 0) gte 1 or (_sera.cadence or 0) gte 50>><<set _sera.questStage to Math.max(_sera.questStage or 0, 4)>><<set _sera.nextQuestDay to Time.days + 1>><<set $mpClockParts to ($mpClockParts or 0) + 2>><<stress 1>><<else>><<set _sera.setback to Time.days + 2>><<set _sera.rep to Math.max(0, (_sera.rep or 50) - 5)>><<set $mpClockParts to Math.max(0, ($mpClockParts or 0) - 1)>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpgearicon>><<link [[收妥发条与家书 (0:14)|MP NPC Sera Quest Step 3B]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($mpClockParts or 0) gte 1 or (_sera.cadence or 0) gte 50>><<set _sera.questStage to Math.max(_sera.questStage or 0, 4)>><<set _sera.nextQuestDay to Time.days + 1>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 5)>><<stress -1>><<else>><<set _sera.setback to Time.days + 2>><<set _sera.rep to Math.max(0, (_sera.rep or 50) - 5)>><<set $mpClockParts to Math.max(0, ($mpClockParts or 0) - 1)>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest Step 3B [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpInitNpcSera>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if Time.days lt (_sera.setback or 0)>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Closed">>
<<elseif Time.days lt (_sera.nextQuestDay or 0)>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif Time.hour lt 8 or Time.hour gte 18>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif (_sera.questStage or 0) isnot 4>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif (_sera.fatherLog or 0) lt 5>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<</if>>
<<if !$mpSeraCharterReturned>><<set $mpSeraCharterReturned to 1>><<set _sera.rep to Math.max(0, (_sera.rep or 50) - 10)>><</if>>
<<if $mpSeraBetrayal is "expose">>行会门前已经摊开那叠铜料单，师叔的签押成了整条高街的谈资。<<elseif $mpSeraBetrayal is "cover">>那叠铜料单被她重新夹回账本最深处，只有你和她见过那个落款。<<else>>旧案的账页还压在柜台抽屉里，谁也没再提起那个落款。<</if>>
为了把父亲留下的温差摆轮与亲笔家书平安带出雾角主塔，<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>在塔门前做出了让步：她当场摘下钟表铺悬挂了二十年的皇家官办修表铜牌交还港务局，放弃了每季度的官办津贴，换回一张盖着注销红印的旧档回执，父亲的名字总算从通缉簿上划掉。她把回执折好收进内袋。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回钟表总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[护住恒力发条 (0:15)|MP NPC Sera Quest Step 4]]>><<pass 15>><<if (_sera.cadence or 0) gte 45 or (_sera.trust or 0) gte 20>><<set _sera.questStage to Math.max(_sera.questStage or 0, 5)>><<set _sera.nextQuestDay to Time.days + 1>><<set _sera.trust to Math.min(100, (_sera.trust or 0) + 3)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set _sera.setback to Time.days + 2>><<set _sera.rep to Math.max(0, (_sera.rep or 50) - 5)>><<set $mpClockParts to Math.max(0, ($mpClockParts or 0) - 1)>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpbellicon>><<link [[敲响潮汐钟正父名 (0:14)|MP NPC Sera Quest Step 4]]>><<pass 14>><<if (_sera.cadence or 0) gte 45 or (_sera.trust or 0) gte 20>><<set _sera.questStage to Math.max(_sera.questStage or 0, 5)>><<set _sera.nextQuestDay to Time.days + 1>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 4)>><<stress -1>><<else>><<set _sera.setback to Time.days + 2>><<set _sera.rep to Math.max(0, (_sera.rep or 50) - 5)>><<set $mpClockParts to Math.max(0, ($mpClockParts or 0) - 1)>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest Step 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpInitNpcSera>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if Time.days lt (_sera.setback or 0)>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Closed">>
<<elseif Time.days lt (_sera.nextQuestDay or 0)>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif Time.hour lt 8 or Time.hour gte 20>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif (_sera.questStage or 0) isnot 5>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif (_sera.fatherLog or 0) lt 6>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif $mpSeraReady>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Step 4B">>
<</if>>
回到钟表铺二楼，父亲留下的那封远洋家书与温差摆轮并排摊在灯下。信末写着他在南洋小岛建了一座新天文台，但那枚纯银止动销既是开启怀表的钥匙，也是记录远洋航线唯一刻度的坐标尺——拔掉止销修好怀表，坐标刻度就会被齿轮磨平。塞拉把六页手记按顺序压好，说这是父亲留给她的最后一道题。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回钟表总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[将摆轮嵌表槽 (0:15)|MP NPC Sera Quest Step 4B]]>><<pass 15>><<if (_sera.cadence or 0) gte 55 or (_sera.trust or 0) gte 30>><<set $mpSeraReady to 1>><<set _sera.nextQuestDay to Time.days + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set _sera.setback to Time.days + 2>><<set _sera.rep to Math.max(0, (_sera.rep or 50) - 5)>><<set $mpClockParts to Math.max(0, ($mpClockParts or 0) - 1)>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[逐行展读远洋家书 (0:14)|MP NPC Sera Quest Step 4B]]>><<pass 14>><<if (_sera.cadence or 0) gte 55 or (_sera.trust or 0) gte 30>><<set $mpSeraReady to 1>><<set _sera.nextQuestDay to Time.days + 1>><<set _sera.love to Math.min(100, (_sera.love or 0) + 4)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<set _sera.setback to Time.days + 2>><<set _sera.rep to Math.max(0, (_sera.rep or 50) - 5)>><<set $mpClockParts to Math.max(0, ($mpClockParts or 0) - 1)>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest Step 4B [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpInitNpcSera>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if $mpSeraEnded>><<if $mpWorldSeraEnding is "depart">><<goto "MP NPC Sera Ending Departed">><<else>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Ending SecondFloor">><</if>>
<<elseif Time.days lt (_sera.setback or 0)>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Closed">>
<<elseif Time.days lt (_sera.nextQuestDay or 0)>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif Time.hour lt 8 or Time.hour gte 20>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif !$mpSeraReady>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Waiting">>
<<elseif $mpSeraIrreversibleChoice>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Step 4C">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpSeraBetrayal is "expose">>摊开过的铜料单还压在账册最上层。<<elseif $mpSeraBetrayal is "cover">>那张铜料单仍夹在账本深处。<<else>>铜料单收在暗格里，无人再提。<</if>>
<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>捏着黄铜镊子停在纯银止动销上方，等你做那个不可逆的决定：若拔除止销让父亲的怀表重新走字，销上的远洋航线刻度将被齿轮彻底磨平，她将永远留在这座小镇与你共守二楼天文工坊；若保留止销上的刻度不修怀表，她便会买下远洋船票出海寻父，把整间钟表铺与逆跳怀表留给你代管。<<if $mpSeraCharterReturned>>灯下还摊着她交还皇家铜牌换来的注销文书，铺子从此少了每季的官办津贴。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回钟表总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[拔止销筑工坊 (0:14)|MP NPC Sera Quest Step 4C]]>><<pass 14>><<set $mpSeraIrreversibleChoice to "stay">><<set _sera.love to Math.min(100, (_sera.love or 0) + 5)>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 2)>><</link>><br>
<<mpmap2icon>><<link [[保留刻度送寻父 (0:14)|MP NPC Sera Quest Step 4C]]>><<pass 14>><<set $mpSeraIrreversibleChoice to "depart">><<set _sera.trust to Math.min(100, (_sera.trust or 0) + 5)>><<stress 2>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest Step 4C [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpInitNpcSera>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if $mpSeraEnded>><<if $mpWorldSeraEnding is "depart">><<goto "MP NPC Sera Ending Departed">><<else>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Ending SecondFloor">><</if>>
<<elseif !$mpSeraIrreversibleChoice>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Step 4B">>
<</if>>
<<if $mpSeraIrreversibleChoice is "depart">>
纯银止动销原封不动地锁回表壳，远洋航线刻度被完整拓进航海图。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>开始清点行囊与船期，并将全镇时刻盘的发条控制权与铺面账册一项项交接到你手里。她说船票在三天后。
<<else>>
黄铜镊子稳稳拔出纯银止动销，停摆十年的怀表瞬间发出清脆悦耳的滴答声，销身上的远洋刻度随之被转动的齿轮磨平。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>烧掉了远洋船票单，将每日下午至深夜的日程全部改到了二楼新建的天文工坊。她说远洋的航线她不要了，留下来把父亲的怀表修到分秒不差。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回钟表总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[进钟表铺终章夜 (0:12)|MP NPC Sera Quest Finale]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Quest Finale [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpInitNpcSera>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if $mpSeraEnded>><<if $mpWorldSeraEnding is "depart">><<goto "MP NPC Sera Ending Departed">><<else>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Ending SecondFloor">><</if>>
<<elseif !$mpSeraIrreversibleChoice>><<goto "MP NPC Sera Quest Step 4B">>
<</if>>
十年前停摆的怀表案终于走到了终点，当前节律共鸣 <<print (_sera.cadence or 25)>>，六页父志全部合拢。<<if $mpSeraIrreversibleChoice is "depart">>远洋客轮的汽笛已经在旧港响起<<else>>二楼天文工坊的星盘已经校准完毕<</if>>，<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>站在母钟前，等你一同见证最后的钟声。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回钟表总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpSeraIrreversibleChoice is "stay">>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[拔销建二层坊 (0:25)|MP NPC Sera Ending SecondFloor]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpSeraTimetableUnlocked to 1>><<set _sera.cadence to 100>><<set _sera.love to Math.min(100, (_sera.love or 0) + 12)>><<set _sera.trust to 100>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[保留刻度送她出海 (0:25)|MP NPC Sera Ending Departed]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpSeraTimetableUnlocked to 1>><<set _sera.cadence to 100>><<set _sera.trust to 100>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Sera Ending SecondFloor [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if $mpSeraEnded and $mpWorldSeraEnding is "depart">><<goto "MP NPC Sera Ending Departed">><</if>>
<<set _already to ($mpSeraEnded or 0)>>
<<set $mpSeraEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldSeraEnding to "stay">><<set $mpWorldSeraSecondFloor to 1>><<set $mpWorldSeraDeparted to 0>><<set $mpSeraIrreversibleChoice to "stay">>
<<if !_already>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("sera_ending_secondfloor_v40")>><<money 1800>><<set $mpClockParts to ($mpClockParts or 0) + 3>><</if>>
<<stress -12>><<trauma -6>>
<</if>>
父亲的银怀表与高街母钟以分秒不差的节律同频摆动，二楼阁楼正式扩建为敞亮的天文钟表工坊。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>不再独自守着冰冷的柜台，每逢入夜便与你并肩坐在观星天窗下，听全城的钟声在你们脚下汇合。她放弃了远洋航线，铺面每周的维护费从此多出一笔，她却说这笔钱花得值。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回钟表总枢 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[上二层观星象 (0:20)|MP NPC Sera Tier And Loft]]>><<pass 20>><<if !_already>><<set _sera.love to Math.min(100, (_sera.love or 0) + 4)>><<stress -8>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[在二楼坊精密修表 (0:15)|MP NPC Sera Repair Hub]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Ending Departed [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if $mpSeraEnded and $mpWorldSeraEnding is "stay">><<goto "MP NPC Sera Ending SecondFloor">><</if>>
<<set _already to ($mpSeraEnded or 0)>>
<<set $mpSeraEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldSeraEnding to "depart">><<set $mpWorldSeraDeparted to 1>><<set $mpWorldSeraSecondFloor to 0>><<set $mpSeraIrreversibleChoice to "depart">>
<<if !_already>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("sera_ending_departed_v40")>><<money 2000>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
<<stress -10>><<trauma -6>>
<</if>>
三号栈桥的汽笛长鸣，<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>带着那枚刻有航线坐标的止动销登上了远洋邮轮。登船前她把自己的双游丝逆跳怀表与高街钟表铺的大门钥匙郑重挂在你掌心，让你全权代管铺面分红，并约好等她携父归来时再与你对表。自她出海后，柜台上少了三问表那一路客单，修表委托的收入也比从前薄了一截。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回钟表总枢 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[代管铺面结算分红 (0:15)|MP NPC Sera Repair Hub]]>><<pass 15>><<if !$mpSeraEndingDividend>><<set $mpSeraEndingDividend to 1>><<money 400>><<stress -4>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[摩挲留存怀表 (0:10)|MP NPC Sera Watch Rewind]]>><<pass 10>><<if !$daily.mpSeraMourn>><<set $daily.mpSeraMourn to 1>><<stress -6>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Schedule [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcSera>><<mpInitNpcCross>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$mpWorldSeraEnding and ($mpWorldSeraSecondFloor or $mpWorldSeraDeparted)>><<set $mpWorldSeraEnding to ($mpWorldSeraDeparted ? "depart" : "stay")>><</if>>
<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>的日常像天文母钟的齿轮一样分秒不差：<<if Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lt 12>>晨间在前厅对照八点晨钟校准航海表<<elseif Time.hour gte 12 and Time.hour lt 18>>午后在无影灯下拆洗三问怀表与镇钟机芯<<else>>入夜后上二楼核对天文星图与父亲手记<</if>>。<<if $mpWorldSeraDeparted>>自她出海寻父后，铺面全天由你代管。<<elseif $mpWorldSeraSecondFloor>>自二层工坊落成后，她入夜常在天窗下等你。<</if>><<if $mpWorldSeraEnding is "stay">>铺面每周多支一笔维护费。<<elseif $mpWorldSeraEnding is "depart">>修表委托少了一路，收入也薄了些。<</if>>
柜台上的黄铜座钟一格格平稳跳动，擒纵轮咬合的轻响在屋内回荡。你定下心神，将手头的器物与册页再次核对妥当。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[翻看柜台条 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Note]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[守时分层陪伴 (0:08)|MP NPC Sera Tier And Loft]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[重温那件事余波 (0:08)|MP NPC Cross Sera Hub]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<link [[去钟楼脚下偶遇她 (0:08)|MP NPC Sera Street 5]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Note [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcSera>><<mpInitNpcCross>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, rep: 50, fatherLog: 0 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
你推门步入钟表铺时修表台后无人落座，黄铜校时牌旁立着一张精确到分的铜版便条：<<if (_sera.cadence or 25) gte 70>>『我去钟楼核对三号镇钟摆幅，紫铜壶里温着佛手柑红茶，二楼螺旋梯的木栓没锁，十二点整或十八点整分秒不差回来见你。』<<elseif (_sera.cadence or 25) gte 35>>『去行会领一批黄铜游丝，整点前归铺，勿拨动母钟左摆。』<<else>>『外出校钟，整点后开铺，急件请留条。』<</if>>
柜台上的黄铜座钟一格格平稳跳动，擒纵轮咬合的轻响在屋内回荡。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回作息 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Schedule]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[按点签留条 (0:06)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><<if !$daily.mpSeraNoteSign>><<set $daily.mpSeraNoteSign to 1>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 2)>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[前往同城交集 (0:06)|MP NPC Cross Sera Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Street 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
高街钟楼脚下的石板广场上，<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>正手握秒表仰头核对塔钟分针的跳动间隔。当前节律共鸣为 <<print (_sera.cadence or 25)>>：<<if (_sera.cadence or 25) gte 50>>她听见你的脚步声甚至不必回头，便准确报出你比平时的步频快了半拍，顺手把温在口袋里的怀表递给你暖手<<else>>她按下秒表停顿键记完日差，抬头向你微微颔首<</if>>。
柜台上的黄铜座钟一格格平稳跳动，擒纵轮咬合的轻响在屋内回荡。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回上一页 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Schedule]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpbellicon>><<link [[陪数正午钟声 (0:10)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if !$daily.mpNpcStreetSera5>><<set $daily.mpNpcStreetSera5 to 1>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 2)>><<set _sera.trust to Math.min(100, (_sera.trust or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<tiredness 1>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[提工具箱回钟表铺 (0:12)|MP NPC Sera Repair Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<if !$daily.mpNpcStreetSera5>><<set $daily.mpNpcStreetSera5 to 1>><<set _sera.trust to Math.min(100, (_sera.trust or 0) + 2)>><<set $mpClockParts to ($mpClockParts or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Daily 15 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcSera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
无影煤油灯下摆着盛有钟表专用骨油的小玛瑙碟，<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>正用极细的油针给备用摆轮红宝石轴承点油。当前节律共鸣为 <<print (_sera.cadence or 25)>>：<<if (_sera.cadence or 25) gte 45>>她握住你的手腕引着油针落下一滴毫厘不差的油珠，并把一枚打磨光滑的黄铜小齿轮系成书签送给你<<else>>她轻声提醒你点油只取半滴，多了反而会粘住游丝<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回守时陪伴 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Tier And Loft]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpgearicon>><<link [[捏着油针点轴承 (0:10)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if !$daily.mpNpcDailySera15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailySera15 to 1>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 2)>><<set _sera.trust to Math.min(100, (_sera.trust or 0) + 2)>><<stress -2>><<tiredness 2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[擦亮旧铜摆轮 (0:08)|MP NPC Sera Deep Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<if !$daily.mpNpcDailySera15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailySera15 to 1>><<set _sera.love to Math.min(100, (_sera.love or 0) + 2)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
